# AgentSwarm + Recall — paste your keys here, then save this file as `.env`
# (same folder: E:\agent-swarm\.env). `.env` is gitignored; this example is not.
#
# You need NONE of these to run the app or the tests. They only matter for
# judging transcripts and for the dataset evals. Ollama is free and needs no key.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE BILLING FACT, because it is easy to get backwards:
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   -> a SEPARATE pay-per-token account. Does NOT touch
#                          your Claude subscription. Measured ~$2.65 for the
#                          full corpus.
#   the `claude` CLI    -> THIS is what spends the Max subscription. Measured
#                          $0.0221 for a 10-token prompt, because every call
#                          ships ~24k tokens of Claude Code's own system prompt.
#   ollama              -> free, local, offline. Costs nothing, ever.
# So the zero-setup path was the expensive one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


# --- Free. Recommended first. No key needed; just `ollama serve`. -----------
OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
OPENAI_API_KEY=ollama
AS_MODEL=qwen3:4b
# NOTE: measured — a 4B model CANNOT do the judging. It paraphrases instead of
# copying, which is the one thing the faithfulness gate exists to catch.
# `recall index` refuses sub-12B local models on purpose. Use it for retrieval
# experiments and smoke tests, not for building real cards.


# --- Groq: free tier, fast, good enough to judge. Best cheap real option. ---
# console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=

# --- DeepSeek: ~$0.14 per million input tokens. ----------------------------
# platform.deepseek.com
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# --- OpenRouter: one key, many models. -------------------------------------
# openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# --- Together --------------------------------------------------------------
TOGETHER_API_KEY=

# --- Anthropic: pay-per-token, SEPARATE from your subscription. ------------
# console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- OpenAI ----------------------------------------------------------------
OPENAI_KEY=


# --- Kaggle ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed if a future dataset lives on Kaggle. Nothing here needs it today.
# The kaggle library insists on reading C:\Users\vaish\.kaggle\kaggle.json, so
# it cannot live on E:. These two vars are the documented way around that:
KAGGLE_USERNAME=
KAGGLE_KEY=


# --- Where Recall keeps its store ------------------------------------------
# Default puts the SQLite store on E: instead of your home directory on C:.
RECALL_HOME=E:/agent-swarm/recall/.store
